","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-16T15:33:27Z","updated_at":"2026-03-16T15:33:27Z","body":"> How does it work for a meshinstance without a mesh assigned? What happens for an object without AABB, for example just a node3D?\r\n\r\nIt preserves the old behavior of maintaining camera distance.\r\n\r\nDemo (including different size objects):\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/08d9d592-a5f7-4e6b-a61c-13e3da245f5f\r\n\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4068552615/reactions","total_count":4,"+1":4,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4071350422","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114397#issuecomment-4071350422","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114397","id":4071350422,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7yq-CW","user":{"login":"ryevdokimov","id":105675984,"node_id":"U_kgDOBkx80A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/105675984?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov","html_url":"https://github.com/ryevdokimov","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-16T23:44:37Z","updated_at":"2026-03-17T00:00:24Z","body":"Hmm, this whole focus/follow thing is tricky...\r\n\r\nI like double `F`, for ease and discoverability, but I hope it doesn't assume too much about user intent. \r\n\r\nI've adjusted the code so that zooming also resets the follow count (if you're not already following) and changing selection, then toggling follow mode doesn't reset the focus distance. I think this allows the most flexibility without being too invasive, but I'm not married to it. \r\n\r\nPersonally, I like to fiddle around and look at things at different perspectives and be able to return to some kind neutral point. \r\n\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/155d6663-23d4-46bc-b855-09c42c3e4fda\r\n\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4071350422/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5855982533","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114397#issuecomment-5855982533","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114397","id":5855982533,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABXQszxQ","user":{"login":"JekSun97","id":130399274,"node_id":"U_kgDOB8W8Kg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/130399274?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JekSun97","html_url":"https://github.com/JekSun97","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JekSun97/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JekSun97/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JekSun97/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JekSun97/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JekSun97/subscriptions","organizations_url":"h